{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach visible object. Take it. Check properties. Do specific task. Move to destination. Scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    />  <Action ID = TakeObject    />  <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />  <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />  <Action ID = MoveToDestination    />  <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />  <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
